Tanda soal berlian (�?) = rantaian encoding putus (klien/lajur/sambungan tidak sepadan). Selaraskan semua ke utf8mb4: pelayan, DB, tabel, lajur DAN sambungan (`SET NAMES`).

```sql
CREATE DATABASE kedai CHARACTER SET utf8mb4 COLLATE utf8mb4_unicode_ci;
CREATE USER 'app'@'10.0.0.%' IDENTIFIED WITH caching_sha2_password BY 'DARI-VAULT';
GRANT SELECT, INSERT, UPDATE, DELETE ON kedai.* TO 'app'@'10.0.0.%';
FLUSH PRIVILEGES;
```
utf8mb4 dari mula (emoji selamat), caching_sha2 (bukan native legacy), host terhad (bukan `%`), keizinan minima (bukan ALL). Kata laluan dari vault — skrip tanpa rahsia keras.

```js
import mysql from 'mysql2/promise';
const pool = mysql.createPool({
  host: process.env.DB_HOST, user: 'app', password: process.env.DB_PASS,
  database: 'kedai', waitForConnections: true,
  connectionLimit: 20, queueLimit: 100,
});
// guna: const [rows] = await pool.query('SELECT * FROM u WHERE id = ?', [id]);
```
`connectionLimit` × instan ≤ `max_connections` pelayan; `queueLimit` gagal pantas (bukan gantung infiniti); `pool.query` auto-lepas. Kata laluan env, SSL (`ssl: {rejectUnauthorized: true}`) untuk jauh.

```sql
CREATE TABLE sesi (
  id BINARY(16) PRIMARY KEY DEFAULT (UUID_TO_BIN(UUID(), 1)),
  pengguna_id INT NOT NULL,
  dibuat TIMESTAMP DEFAULT CURRENT_TIMESTAMP
);
-- papar: SELECT BIN_TO_UUID(id) FROM sesi;
